abstract: >-
  Original code, configurations, frozen analysis data and supporting source inputs
  for an observational six-city study of local street network substitutability
  and arterial traffic volumes. Software is MIT licensed; source and derived
  databases retain separate terms documented in DATA_LICENSES.md, including ODbL.
